+Verify http://localhost:3000/api/health. A 503 `database: unreachable` means PostgreSQL is stopped or `DATABASE_URL` is wrong. If health is ok but there are no products, run `npm run db:seed` and restart `npm run dev`. Seeding deletes existing orders.
